// Title: Copy .DMP/.DUMP Files From Remote Share Via Cmd.EXE
// ID: 044ba588-dff4-4918-9808-3f95e8160606
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-27
// Tags: attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects usage of the copy builtin cmd command to copy files with the ".dmp"/".dump" extension from a remote share
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_copy *" and process.command_line like "*_ \\\\\\\\*") and (process.command_line like "*_.dmp*" or process.command_line like "*_.dump*" or process.command_line like "*_.hdmp*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\cmd.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "Cmd.Exe")))
